{"4925610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blast Horizon", "steam_appid": 4925610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4988610], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Screen Belongs to your Enemy - Take it Back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this classic Shmup, you will fight through impossible odds against hostiles flooding the battlefield from every direction. Every second is a test of positioning and precision while turning the battlefield into a storm of explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Positioning is Key!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space isn't just where the battle takes place, it's your greatest weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip between  bullet patterns, avoid getting into vulnerable positions, and always be exactly where the next volley isn't!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925610/extras/0dd72155138b51136868fa07db869363.avif?t=1788197532\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925610/extras_big/0dd72155138b51136868fa07db869363.avif?t=1788197532 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>What's your Strategy?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the screen fills with enemies, your choices define your fate. Do you unleash a powerful bomb to erase the chaos around you, or save it for the moment when everything is on the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925610/extras/b9af19c7ebd6ea7190394342bf19f70a.avif?t=1788197532\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925610/extras_big/b9af19c7ebd6ea7190394342bf19f70a.avif?t=1788197532 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic arcade-inspired Shoot Em up gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action focused on dodging and precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player experience designed for score chasing and repeated runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode to try out new strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful bombs to escape overwhelming situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging stages that test skill and positioning </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Screen Belongs to your Enemy - Take it Back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this classic Shmup, you will fight through impossible odds against hostiles flooding the battlefield from every direction. Every second is a test of positioning and precision while turning the battlefield into a storm of explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Positioning is Key!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space isn't just where the battle takes place, it's your greatest weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip between  bullet patterns, avoid getting into vulnerable positions, and always be exactly where the next volley isn't!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925610/extras/0dd72155138b51136868fa07db869363.avif?t=1788197532\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925610/extras_big/0dd72155138b51136868fa07db869363.avif?t=1788197532 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>What's your Strategy?</u></strong></